WEBVTT

00:12:32.880 --> 00:12:37.176
Nisikilize na uone kama unaweza kuwaza

00:12:37.200 --> 00:12:42.536
utamaduni wa uweupe kama
harakati inayoondoa utu

00:12:42.560 --> 00:12:44.016
inayoyeyusha mbali

00:12:44.040 --> 00:12:49.976
utambulisho wetu wote
wa utofauti na unaofungana,

00:12:50.000 --> 00:12:55.816
kama vile taifa, daraja,
na jinsia,

00:12:55.840 --> 00:12:57.040
ilimradi ...

00:12:58.880 --> 00:13:03.640
ili umoja uendelee kwa ajili ya nguvu.